an></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Altar_of_Fecundity\" title=\"Altar of Fecundity\">Altar of Fecundity</a></b>, <a href=\"/page/Altar_of_Fecundity_-_Manufactured_Ingredient_Recipes\" title=\"Altar of Fecundity - Manufactured Ingredient Recipes\">Manufactured Ingredient Recipes</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Legendary_Taint_of_Shavarath\" title=\"Legendary Taint of Shavarath\">Legendary Taint of Shavarath</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Legendary_Taint_of_Shavarath\" title=\"Legendary Taint of Shavarath\">Legendary Taint of Shavarath</a>:</b> Green Steel items thirst for pain and suffering. While weapons feed their bloodlust on enemies, accessories and clothing cannot. Wearing multiple items that bear the Legendary Taint of Shavarath creates dangerous imbalances of energy as the items feed more and more upon the wielder. Perhaps there is a way to appease this item...</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Legendary_Green_Steel_Weave_Boots.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Legendary_Green_Steel_Weave_Boots.png/420px-Legendary_Green_Steel_Weave_Boots.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"386\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Legendary_Green_Steel_Weave_Boots.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\"><a href=\"/page/Legendary_Green_Steel\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Legendary Green Steel\">Legendary Green Steel</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>Boots crafted from green steel.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<p><b>Legendary Green Steel Weave Boots</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>100 <a href=\"/page/Item:Codex_Rune\" title=\"Item:Codex Rune\">Codex Runes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Item:Commendation_of_Valor\" title=\"Item:Commendation of Valor\">100&#32;Commendations of Valor</a></li></ul>\n<p>Made at the <a href=\"/page/Altar_of_Fecundity\" title=\"Altar of Fecundity\">Altar of Fecundity</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817052011\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.061 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.119 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2382/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 17247/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4163/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n135.55%  140.499     32 Template:IO\n100.00%  